# raw TSRD .h5 captures are ~380MB total -- too large for git.
# The precomputed busy-map cache (backend/data/cache/*.npz, a few hundred
# KB) IS committed and is all the app needs to run. Drop raw .h5 files here
# only if you want to regenerate that cache from scratch.
backend/data/h5/*.h5
